# Slice 5.5 AI-only identification demo.
#
# Locally valid (clean name, clean labels, service known to the inventory) but
# semantically inconsistent: the name says the metric is a duration in seconds,
# while the label unit="bytes" contradicts that. Deterministic local rules cannot
# understand this contradiction, so only the LLM flags it (meaningless_metric).
http_request_duration_seconds{unit="bytes",service="payment-api"} 12
# Locally severe: forbidden high-cardinality label user_id. The LLM must NOT be
# able to downgrade this rule finding.
http_user_requests_total{user_id="u1",service="payment-api"} 1
http_user_requests_total{user_id="u2",service="payment-api"} 1
